<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 191 0 R
/T (Toxic behavior in online gaming, especially in competitive titles like Valorant, remains a persistent issue despite Riot Games and Mojang studios moderation efforts. While the company has issued numerous chat restrictions and bans, many players report that toxicity, including harassment and verbal abuse, continues largely unchecked. For instance, in January 2022, Riot Games issued over 400,000 text and voice chat restrictions and banned more than 40,000 players for toxic communications. Complaints on platforms like Reddit highlight that reporting systems often feel ineffective, with little visible action taken against repeat offenders. Additionally, studies show that offensive behavior remains widespread, raising concerns about the limitations of current moderation tools.)
/E (Toxic behavior in online gaming, especially in competitive titles like Valorant, remains a persistent issue despite Riot Games and Mojang studios moderation efforts. While the company has issued numerous chat restrictions and bans, many players report that toxicity, including harassment and verbal abuse, continues largely unchecked. For instance, in January 2022, Riot Games issued over 400,000 text and voice chat restrictions and banned more than 40,000 players for toxic communications. Complaints on platforms like Reddit highlight that reporting systems often feel ineffective, with little visible action taken against repeat offenders. Additionally, studies show that offensive behavior remains widespread, raising concerns about the limitations of current moderation tools.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
