/T (Sentiment Analysis in Dota 2 Singh's research \(2022\) focuses on analyzing in-game chat data from Dota 2 to identify instances of cyberbullying. Recognizing that traditional sentiment analysis tools may not effectively capture the unique language used in gaming communities, Singh developed an updated lexicon tailored to Dota 2's specific terminology. This approach aimed to enhance the accuracy of sentiment classification within the game's context.Highly negative logs were recommended for further review by human moderators to ensure appropriate handling of potential cyberbullying incidents. )
/E (Sentiment Analysis in Dota 2 Singh's research \(2022\) focuses on analyzing in-game chat data from Dota 2 to identify instances of cyberbullying. Recognizing that traditional sentiment analysis tools may not effectively capture the unique language used in gaming communities, Singh developed an updated lexicon tailored to Dota 2's specific terminology. This approach aimed to enhance the accuracy of sentiment classification within the game's context.Highly negative logs were recommended for further review by human moderators to ensure appropriate handling of potential cyberbullying incidents. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
