/T (Sentiment Analysis in league of legends Pongkhan et al. \(2024\) investigate sentiment analysis in the League of Legends gaming community, focusing on in-game chat conversations. Their study addresses challenges in processing unstructured text rich in gaming slang, abbreviations, and unconventional grammar. By leveraging natural language processing \(NLP\) techniques, they analyze player sentiments to better understand community dynamics and identify toxic behavior, contributing to enhanced moderation and player experience in online gaming environments.)
